# The build context needs Go source, go.mod, and web/ — nothing else.
# Above all it must never contain the runtime state file: it holds every
# partner credential in plaintext, and `COPY . .` would bake it into the
# build-stage layers of the image.
*.state.json
*.state.json.tmp
*.audit.jsonl
*.zip
*.exe
xlate
livetest/
demo/
deploy/
docs/
.github/
.git/
.claude/
*.md
